b24c" form="finalis" /><syllable xml:id="m-dc8dd0bb-d774-49cb-a890-58ada08853c2"><syl /><neume facs="#m-d26b27e3-48b3-4731-995b-90443d439b93" type="compound" xml:id="m-d1f2e4c0-f75e-40c5-97d4-2de798c3a8d5"><nc xml:id="m-0d47df99-c34a-4813-a6c4-2fbd57c80898" pname="f" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-06895f62-da72-458e-9504-c4b5b5d7a28a" pname="d" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-8f310807-dc6e-490f-aeb4-6557f1151d66" pname="e" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-89a9dc99-5bb6-4aed-bda0-e8b2ebd6e3c2" pname="f" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-155c9298-0e59-4566-bb03-dc882a4c4293" pname="d" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-f6090917-a9c1-4fe5-ab0b-eb3cc17b703a"><syl /><neume facs="#m-a9c7ef69-6725-49e4-8e7a-2f1c3088b151" type="punctum" xml:id="m-8c6a9b17-912d-40bc-8633-18153cde195c"><nc xml:id="m-1e594b5e-4281-4e53-a896-69ed3c2a4c9b" pname="f" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-b79c7b3f-4123-49f2-ad55-5f8a64f47794"><syl /><neume facs="#m-11082473-3518-4262-bbdf-56592bab722e" type="punctum" xml:id="m-e7d39cb1-d5a2-429b-83ae-f6d1caaf80e1"><nc xml:id="m-213c2859-c50d-4957-88e9-df0fe8af6c3b" pname="f" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-08bba5e5-b0f2-4f1e-8b2f-aa7d49aa7006"><syl /><neume facs="#m-fd36ed95-ab08-401a-a921-33b26b1f4ad2" type="torculus" xml:id="m-4f35b282-492b-4872-a9cd-b3dda9175a96"><nc xml:id="m-c7bfa5b2-5ba0-4872-ae26-e07ef7e92340" pname="e" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-cf6b9a50-9801-4c4b-bce7-9346122adcca" pname="f" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-f334af61-bb66-4582-a868-88524c643331" pname="c" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-65172dd1-70b3-4f61-93b9-cb13f5e56ee7"><syl /><neume facs="#m-088961b9-3352-4f76-847d-0b7748bd9675" type="virga" xml:id="m-75a71cb5-58ef-4ec4-ae6c-16d9c4c1352e"><nc xml:id="m-f18da782-360e-42d8-8a3e-967fdc232209" pname="f" oct="3" /></neume></syllable></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-0f936b73-1a5d-4939-9033-5eead21d1cc9">
            <lg xml:id="m-61220a98-a4f5-43f3-9826-bd5685da6708">
              <l xml:id="m-21b22d64-6eeb-4d15-8f36-edff66ad1178" facs="#m-bbc9996b-44e6-4709-8eff-e6ad794c357a" label="ambiguous">1480</l><l xml:id="m-83c2c829-2a7c-4763-b2c6-844ea2842b2f" facs="#m-85608eca-bfb4-4e64-940f-40396a56992d" label="ambiguous">Iune 13. 14.</l><l xml:id="m-b30485f9-02cd-4562-9134-d8da8c7f2c70" facs="#m-5afd2b02-675e-4711-adc2-5b837b6743a6" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-70651968-dd6c-4b6b-a106-b2465482702d" facs="#m-57a795b8-5482-42b2-8809-95728ea41ac9" label="lyrics-like">DRO sanctórum tuórum Basilidis, ¡ Dómine, solémniter immolámus, tua</l><l xml:id="m-e8f1c145-2a83-41a0-ab64-7861827f4d6a" facs="#m-54816ef3-70f1-4dd0-988b-aceefc8ef14d" label="lyrics-like">LCyríni, Nabóris atque Nazárii l mirabilia pertractántes : per quem</l><l xml:id="m-eba87744-0479-4b30-a0c3-c4ad8f6f055c" facs="#m-44d4fce3-33da-43dc-af71-d1a18cb77813" label="lyrics-like">sánguine venerándo, hóstias tibi l talis est perfécta victória. Per Dñum.</l><l xml:id="m-7ba5f3a1-4e1a-42a9-8770-1c7fcb8f83c6" facs="#m-83c0fe4c-9bac-4a06-a0a2-ed1dbd4152dc" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-15f26fe6-dbf1-4f3a-be0f-268a8f219a6a" facs="#m-1ad6b5dd-4b45-4e8b-876e-b33e9a3369f2" label="lyrics-like">NEmper, Dómine, sanctórum! celebrántes: praesta quaésumus;</l><l xml:id="m-8b090b45-93a5-4a85-8349-57038ac8cb1d" facs="#m-e7b42eab-5912-4fa2-a304-99c5f5bad3c1" label="lyrics-like">O Mártyrum tuórum Basilidis, Cy-lut eórum patrocinia júgiter sentiá¬</l><l xml:id="m-b48bfc1a-0d41-46b1-b418-9de29c49adff" facs="#m-2248ca16-608a-4cad-b930-2b045074f89a" label="lyrics-like">rini, Náboris atque Nazárii solémnia! mus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-56707ce2-5163-497d-8c6a-686f5df05ec7" facs="#m-07acb173-495d-4e73-82ec-5a4b5b8a9cf4" label="text-like">St. Anthony of Padua, Confessor,</l><l xml:id="m-c505902e-899d-4596-9d7c-714f9f8befb1" facs="#m-76c1e2cd-515b-4f46-92b3-c9287dc58f85" label="ambiguous">13.</l><l xml:id="m-277be098-da41-4845-81da-0698f4131520" facs="#m-203a5c55-1273-4c6a-bb10-24baf6a61e68" label="text-like">and Doctor of the Church.</l><l xml:id="m-714ef933-a5c8-47cd-8971-9270e37e1be3" facs="#m-561e4d74-9054-43f1-9485-bb52a8dca877" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-56c5307b-dd52-4c68-9e47-3038ac40fbaa" facs="#m-3f16e6f3-f691-45aa-927e-0cb3e7a96209" label="lyrics-like">At Ist Vespers, at Mogn. Ant. O Dóctor óptime... beáte Antóni. p. 262s.</l><l xml:id="m-2a4cb130-0b5a-498b-87f0-297a35d886ee" facs="#m-fd4d8559-c9db-44f6-83ff-32f88df5abbb" label="lyrics-like">Mass. In médio Ecclésiae. D. 1190</l><l xml:id="m-2678ba76-15eb-4aaf-828a-cd910625a6ca" facs="#m-ee66b670-d372-4ef8-b7b2-5afd14be8ffd" label="text-like">The Credo is said.</l><l xml:id="m-9c844468-7e7d-41a8-a70b-8e1bcb09cf8a" facs="#m-171c7d2b-a12a-4d0b-aa4e-90523ca321b9" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-149aaaae-f38b-47f5-a253-8d28bc770f42" facs="#m-6b0e331f-2230-4cfe-82ee-95b7f58db7bf" label="lyrics-like">yCclésiam tuam, Deus, beáti An-lut spirituálibus semper muniátur</l><l xml:id="m-235e4840-7109-40cb-985e-4f8888a93be8" facs="#m-ab4c5b3c-8b1b-404e-88b7-a7833a20979b" label="lyrics-like">U tónii Confessóris tui atque Do-l auxiliis, * et gáudiis pérfrui mereá¬</l><l xml:id="m-15f37a85-948e-4a47-9188-abfc1e798ff3" facs="#m-4f40ca80-712b-46da-a111-30d647b9ec7e" label="lyrics-like">ctóris solémnitas votíva laetificet: t l tur aetérnis. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-7cc6c425-b904-46f9-ab0e-d80112f630d9" facs="#m-94e08a70-56a8-4ac0-bf2d-5d7f87139e5c" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-7949d42c-4dd9-4f31-b2ae-5e693ca96991" facs="#m-8a2f1a64-054c-4063-ba7f-9b8512563e02" label="lyrics-like">ORaesens oblátio fiat, Dómine,!Deo Patre et Spiritu Sancto vivis</l><l xml:id="m-b4a48c17-db8f-43a7-b6c3-e2645b1c31ff" facs="#m-24d4509d-0f93-405f-b94a-4ffbab99d2fc" label="lyrics-like">Epópulo tuo salutáris: pro quo! et regnas Deus per ómnia saécula</l><l xml:id="m-a99ac9de-e13e-409e-a889-54ab71b66c30" facs="#m-8969be1a-a1e7-402d-b2f6-d49ae5108c4f" label="lyrics-like">dignátus es Patri tuo te vivéntem saeculórum.</l><l xml:id="m-e0455179-d25b-4d45-97ec-170caf76737e" facs="#m-cf1f0ec0-006c-478a-8e7f-617842d610fe" label="lyrics-like">hóstiam immolare : Qui cum eódem!</l><l xml:id="m-618f099f-dcc1-4f07-ac89-cb322f5537ce" facs="#m-573ea411-4cdf-44c5-ad79-604919cbb2d2" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-0addd896-71b5-4dec-8490-05f74e874d51" facs="#m-6e540fc1-853b-443d-b09c-49a00b6b0c6e" label="lyrics-like">Ivínis, Dómine, munéribus sa-l ctóris méritis et intercessióne, salu¬</l><l xml:id="m-73514e8d-f7e3-45ce-b784-da96109db4d7" facs="#m-955c1282-0641-4442-b4fe-87efd246a524" label="lyrics-like">Utiáti : quaésumus; ut beáti l táris sacrificii sentiámus efféctum.</l><l xml:id="m-aadefa62-74b3-4879-9b6a-7456acf9fe44" facs="#m-e2082e7d-484b-4980-8bf5-b237ba9c9ef4" label="lyrics-like">Antónii Confessóris tui atque Do-l Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-308a97e7-1ce1-4d5e-9fea-5b1af0b738fd" facs="#m-b1295d30-6a6e-4b0d-8db2-1e3973ac35c7" label="text-like">St. Basil the Great, Bishop, Confessor,</l><l xml:id="m-307a619f-c789-4f96-a998-95c74459cd1a" facs="#m-2a845618-81fe-4828-8b7c-9a6a4569f99e" label="ambiguous">14.</l><l xml:id="m-c1b661d4-fbce-4f46-bf75-0963f2fcb603" facs="#m-f9b30bf6-c3e2-469d-8705-0c191a2c3a39" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-7da9776d-1f29-48d3-b7ec-73fa84d81286" facs="#m-d1659d4a-a4a9-427e-9926-52c3c3f7663b" label="text-like">and Doctor of the Church.</l><l xml:id="m-c6bea424-dc8e-42cb-8994-b60bde871c17" facs="#m-468abf18-ec59-478c-a74d-5d0c4a005923" label="lyrics-like">At Ist and 2nd Vespers, at Magn. Ant. O Dóctor óptime... beá̂te</l><l xml:id="m-30d89142-ff96-4743-a28e-1e335c38b29a" facs="#m-ba0d3ef9-4888-4c4c-a583-aa6e6a97452c" label="ambiguous">Basili. p. 262 s.</l><l xml:id="m-c7513fa7-73e8-4c98-816d-b24a84c25ea0" facs="#m-34407980-8c2f-4d7e-b410-8a8f47804332" label="text-like">At Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-69b9f2b5-8148-4d44-93fc-b71abb8c31a3" facs="#m-abdb7988-43d9-4fde-9b22-f9e591593dd1" label="lyrics-like">Introit. In médio Ecclésiae. p. 1190.</l><l xml:id="m-c009b827-0058-47f1-a9e2-4ad1754f4977" facs="#m-1249b92b-c4a2-413b-a4e3-a7d3992409fa" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-40bebcfc-1f10-4fe3-b6cb-543f0ca33729" facs="#m-fe25a8b7-5c2a-43c8-b37b-e7311d140e0c" label="lyrics-like">«xáudi, quaésumus Dómine, pre- digne méruit famulári, ejus inter¬</l><l xml:id="m-ce02a5e2-8e9d-4f48-8fa8-1307484e458c" facs="#m-0cd86151-eb2a-407d-ac82-9ef0e375cdd5" label="lyrics-like">C ces nostras, quas in beáti Basili cedéntibus méritis, * ab ómnibus</l><l xml:id="m-7c5e6175-5e39-4cf2-8789-0b97975214de" facs="#m-df783b8d-bc34-4720-9932-8bb6f1f3d2fb" label="lyrics-like">Confessóris tui atque Pontificis so- nos absólve peccátis. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-91519115-b747-4b4e-ad44-2732381a7c96" facs="#m-28429577-d7d0-4c9c-a485-23a1462f2e7f" label="lyrics-like">lemnitáte deférimus: t et qui tibi</l><l xml:id="m-17bcd561-7c1b-448a-ae78-06640c6c74da" facs="#m-38746935-b7c7-4aac-835a-e280bb8cc801" label="lyrics-like">Epistte. Testíficor. D. 1190. — Gradual. Os jústi. p. 1191.</l><l xml:id="m-6555c6c9-9ce8-42a5-a14a-f4303150ac27" facs="#m-4c084af5-5690-460d-9610-f44bacb2b8ca" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-a0c08635-57e2-4c50-85e5-83ebcd861e0f" facs="#m-fdbda390-6961-4962-8da4-6f930769c3ed" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-97e6cfd6-fa87-4907-8f1e-e3bdb8117fe2" facs="#m-42d38fcc-f2da-45f9-81ac-5b80d689b268" label="lyrics-like">V. In- vé¬</l><l xml:id="m-57b9ed2b-d3cf-4331-9bda-bc356021faca" facs="#m-63e76ff7-12cf-4a6a-8884-51b170546fe6" label="ambiguous">ii</l><l xml:id="m-023a1b82-a169-4e6d-8d5a-98c2714f98a2" facs="#m-648ab540-82f4-4bee-95d8-04f3eb441ddc" label="lyrics-like">Lle-lú-ia.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>